HEADS AA

START ** REPLACE ** US
REPLACE _# REPLACE _# RR
REPLACE _= REPLACE _~ RR
REPLACE __ GO_DOWN __ DD
GO_DOWN __ REWIND __ LL
REPLACE2 #* REPLACE2 #* RR
REPLACE2 ~* SKIP ~* RR
SKIP ~* SKIP *~ RR
SKIP #* ERASE_LAST ** LL
ERASE_LAST ~* REPLACE2 ~_ RR
REPLACE2 __ STOP __ SS


REWIND !* REWIND ** LL
REWIND __ REPLACE2 __ RR